          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.19.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 19.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake aikilikuanu nanu ajo, keitu doi ening ninche? Eibala ajo etoning'o; amu, “Eshomo oltoilo lenye enkop pooki, nepuo irorei lenye ineeiting'ie enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 32.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naitoki ake nanu aikilikuanu ajo, keitu pasa ening'u Siraeli? Musa oitera ajo, “Apik intae olom too ltung'ana leme olorere; naitagor intae to lorere omoda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.65.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 65.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nenyaaka Isaya ajo te mpijan, “Aanotito lelo leitu aaing'oru nanu, naitoduaayie kewan te lelo leitu aaikilikuanu nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.65.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 65.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake etejo ninye tialo Siraeli, “Aitorioko nkaik aainei endama pooki ailejileju ltung'ana lemening'isho naatanyaita nanu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
